      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>The engineer can leverage his knowledge of engineering to solve tasks that normally require brute strength or keen eyes. He can spend a full-round action to study an object or area and attempt a Knowledge (engineering) check. On his next turn, he can use the result of that Knowledge (engineering) check in place of a Strength check to break the object or in place of a Perception check to locate hidden doors or compartments in that area.</p>",
